      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Allá arriba, Tāwhirimātea tuvo hijos propios.",
          "en": "Up there, Tāwhirimātea had children of his own."
        },
        {
          "es": "Era el único hermano que se quedó con su padre en el cielo.",
          "en": "He was the only brother who stayed with his father in the sky."
        },
        {
          "es": "Eran los vientos que soplan desde todas las direcciones.",
          "en": "They were the winds that blow from every direction."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y muchas clases de nubes: nubes blandas, nubes pesadas y oscuras nubes de tormenta.",
          "en": "And many kinds of clouds: soft clouds, heavy clouds, and dark thunderclouds."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los juntó a todos a su alrededor, como un ejército.",
          "en": "He gathered them all around him, like an army."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y entonces, con un gran rugido, los llevó hacia abajo, hacia el mundo.",
          "en": "Then, with a great roar, he led them down toward the world below."
        }
      ],
