      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Tangaroa se enojó con Tāne, porque su bosque escondía a los reptiles que habían huido.",
          "en": "Tangaroa was furious with Tāne, because Tāne's forest sheltered the runaway reptiles."
        },
        {
          "es": "Desde ese día, el mar y el bosque están en guerra.",
          "en": "From that day on, the sea and the forest have been at war."
        },
        {
          "es": "Tāne le da a la gente canoas, anzuelos, lanzas y redes, hechos de sus árboles y plantas.",
          "en": "Tāne gives people canoes, fishhooks, spears and nets, all made from his trees and plants."
        },
        {
          "es": "Con ellos, la gente atrapa a los hijos de Tangaroa.",
          "en": "With them, people catch the children of Tangaroa."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y Tangaroa se defiende: hunde canoas, inunda la tierra y se come la costa.",
          "en": "And Tangaroa fights back: he sinks canoes, floods the land, and eats away the coast."
        }
